{"id":"n31509-1-10","stage":1,"title":"휴지통 · 废纸篓","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31509-1-10-1","ko":"책상 아래에 둔 수첩 못 봤어?","zh":"你没看到放在桌子下面的笔记本吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"책상","meaning":"书桌","explanation":"책상：书桌","readings":[{"term":"책상","audio":"/audio/e2d1cb559455849bf57e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72039","senseId":"1","lemma":"책상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책상","audio":"/audio/e2d1cb559455849bf57e.mp3"}},{"text":"아래에","meaning":"下，下面","explanation":"아래：下，下面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"아래","audio":"/audio/8f2ea9820639f8b85047.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71288","senseId":"1","lemma":"아래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아래에","audio":"/audio/52d8bcb7a74760ef5ce5.mp3"}},{"text":"둔","meaning":"搁，放置，摆放","explanation":"두다：搁，放置，摆放；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67470","senseId":"1","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"둔","audio":"/audio/116fbf2f245c5cf6c9f8.mp3"}},{"text":"수첩","meaning":"记事本，手册","explanation":"수첩：记事本，手册","readings":[{"term":"수첩","audio":"/audio/ab2bf177646782acd734.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64748","senseId":"1","lemma":"수첩","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수첩","audio":"/audio/ab2bf177646782acd734.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"봤어?","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봤어","audio":"/audio/0d4b5b0b4b8a9c03faf0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e2d1cb559455849b","term":"책상","zh":"书桌","audio":"/audio/e2d1cb559455849bf57e.mp3","entryId":"72039","definition":"供阅读或书写或办公用的桌子。","pronunciation":["책쌍"]},{"id":"8f2ea9820639f8b8","term":"아래","zh":"下，下面","audio":"/audio/8f2ea9820639f8b85047.mp3","entryId":"71288","definition":"比一定基准低的位置。","pronunciation":["아래"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"搁，放置，摆放","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"67470","definition":"放在某处。","pronunciation":["두다"]},{"id":"ab2bf177646782ac","term":"수첩","zh":"记事本，手册","audio":"/audio/ab2bf177646782acd734.mp3","entryId":"64748","definition":"随身携带的用于简单记录的小本子。","pronunciation":["수첩"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e7a7fe312f93a0c337cb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31509-1-10-2","ko":"안 쓰는 건 줄 알고 휴지통에 버렸는데.","zh":"我以为不用了，就把它扔进垃圾桶了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰는","meaning":"用，使用","explanation":"쓰다：用，使用；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓰는","audio":"/audio/6f8201be65ab164072c8.mp3"}},{"text":"건","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건","audio":"/audio/f5fd44f22ad30ad631dc.mp3"}},{"text":"줄","meaning":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","explanation":"줄：表示某个方法或实际内容等。","readings":[{"term":"줄","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91870","senseId":"1","lemma":"줄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줄","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3"}},{"text":"알고","meaning":"以为","explanation":"알다：以为；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"12","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알고","audio":"/audio/8cb0c0a5afacb043256e.mp3"}},{"text":"휴지통에","meaning":"废纸篓，废纸桶，垃圾篓，垃圾桶","explanation":"휴지통：废纸篓，废纸桶，垃圾篓，垃圾桶；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"휴지통","audio":"/audio/e4c9ff36de6c1fadb7b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31509","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴지통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"휴지통에","audio":"/audio/f3757f18ed45e2e24726.mp3"}},{"text":"버렸는데.","meaning":"扔，丢","explanation":"버리다：扔，丢；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"버리다","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65570","senseId":"1","lemma":"버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버렸는데","audio":"/audio/208e24fc044a3c318a65.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"用，使用","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"71285","definition":"做某事时利用材料、工具等。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"4e04e3938cc9c67e","term":"줄","zh":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3","entryId":"91870","definition":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","pronunciation":["줄"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"以为","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于某个事实，认为或觉得如此。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"e4c9ff36de6c1fad","term":"휴지통","zh":"废纸篓，废纸桶，垃圾篓，垃圾桶","audio":"/audio/e4c9ff36de6c1fadb7b8.mp3","entryId":"31509","definition":"用于扔无法使用的纸或垃圾等的桶。","pronunciation":["휴지통"]},{"id":"51654377be6bf0a0","term":"버리다","zh":"扔，丢","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3","entryId":"65570","definition":"丢弃或倒掉没必要继续持有的东西。","pronunciation":["버리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/81b76fd755991afb56a9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.54,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=31509","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":52,"sequenceScore":2.2653,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我以为不用了，就把它扔进垃圾桶了。","因为你不好好学习，那些书才一直在书架上闲置着呢。","你没看到放在桌子下面的笔记本吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我以为不用了，就把它扔进垃圾桶了。","你没看到放在桌子下面的笔记本吗？","因为你不好好学习，那些书才一直在书架上闲置着呢。"],"answer":0}]}
